    check: q4("Which way do DNA fragments move in the gel?", ["Toward the positive electrode (anode)", "Toward the negative electrode (cathode)", "They stay in the well"], 0, "The phosphate backbone is negatively charged, so DNA moves toward the anode."),
    check2: q4("Why plot the ladder as log(size) against distance?", ["Distance falls roughly linearly with log(size) over the gel\u2019s range", "Distance is proportional to size", "Small fragments move more slowly"], 0, "Distance travelled falls roughly linearly as log(size) rises, so a log scale turns the ladder into a straight line to read from."),
